        "steam_appid": 3956600,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956600/extras/03bf8e454e864572f1d106a895e65094.avif?t=1788298109\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They won't get our eggs!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the fantasy world, where you play as the dragon, trying to protect your eggs from the enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They won't get our eggs - is a roguelike game where you need to shoot infinite waves of enemies, attacking your nest.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your dragon and fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy procedurally generated waves of enemies, dont let them get to your nest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the bosses and special enemies to get gold, requiered to upgrade dragons and their fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but addictive gameplay that will be both cozy and challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956600/extras/3a0d1ee6713d94688cfd6bb3f1d64c71.avif?t=1788298109\" width=1144 height=825 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First project developed and published by solo developer.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm solo developer from Ukraine and that's my first project for publicity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting for your feedback!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More features to come!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956600/extras/03bf8e454e864572f1d106a895e65094.avif?t=1788298109\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They won't get our eggs!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the fantasy world, where you play as the dragon, trying to protect your eggs from the enemies. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They won't get our eggs - is a roguelike game where you need to shoot infinite waves of enemies, attacking your nest.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your dragon and fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy procedurally generated waves of enemies, dont let them get to your nest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill the bosses and special enemies to get gold, requiered to upgrade dragons and their fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but addictive gameplay that will be both cozy and challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956600/extras/3a0d1ee6713d94688cfd6bb3f1d64c71.avif?t=1788298109\" width=1144 height=825 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First project developed and published by solo developer.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm solo developer from Ukraine and that's my first project for publicity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waiting for your feedback!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More features to come!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "They won't get our eggs!!! Welcome to the fantasy world, where you play as the dragon, trying to protect your eggs from the enemies.  They won't get our eggs - is a roguelike game where you need to shoot infinite waves of enemies, attacking your nest.",
